### AIGC369 API 测试文件
### 用于验证AIGC369 API的连接和功能

@baseUrl = https://api.aigc369.com/v1
@apiKey = sk-nTnL3K8UoIT98eImMq4aaPDGE3y9qE36xd4mePthb2cG5I5v

### 1. 获取可用模型列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/models HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 测试GPT-4o聊天完成
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "你好！请用中文简单介绍一下你自己，并告诉我你是通过什么API提供服务的。"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 150,
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "stream": false
}

### 3. 测试Claude 3.5 Sonnet
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-latest",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "请用Python写一个简单的计算器函数，支持加减乘除四则运算。"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 500,
  "temperature": 0.3
}

