### 6. 测试O1推理模型 (如果可用)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "o1-mini",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "请解这个数学问题：如果一个正方形的对角线长度是10厘米，那么这个正方形的面积是多少？请详细说明解题步骤。"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 1000
}

### 7. 测试函数调用功能 (GPT-4o)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "今天北京的天气怎么样？"
    }
  ],
  "functions": [
    {
      "name": "get_weather",
      "description": "获取指定城市的天气信息",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "city": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "城市名称"
          }
        },
        "required": ["city"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "function_call": "auto",
  "max_tokens": 150
}

### 8. 测试流式响应
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "请写一首关于春天的短诗。"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 200,
  "temperature": 0.8,
  "stream": true
}

### 9. 测试多轮对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-latest",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "我想学习Python编程，应该从哪里开始？"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "学习Python编程是个很好的选择！我建议你从以下几个步骤开始：\n\n1. **安装Python环境**\n2. **学习基本语法**\n3. **练习编程题目**\n4. **做实际项目**\n\n你目前有编程基础吗？"
    },
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "我完全是零基础，推荐一些适合初学者的资源吧。"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 400,
  "temperature": 0.6
}

### 10. 错误处理测试 - 无效模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "invalid-model-name",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "这应该会返回错误"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 50
}

### 11. 测试API限制 - 超长输入
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user", 
      "content": "请重复以下文字1000遍：Hello World! "
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 50
} 